{"title":"Orc","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 9 Orc that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 1 times (3.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/orcish-grip-wrap\">Orcish Grip Wrap</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=9\">Lv 9 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=10\">Lv 10 <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=11\">Lv 11 <span>10</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=12\">Lv 12 <span>3</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=13\">Lv 13 <span>21</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=15\">Lv 15 <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=16\">Lv 16 <span>9</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=17\">Lv 17 <span>1</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=9\" title=\"Pick level 9\"><td><b>9</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>28</td><td>9.5</td><td>450</td><td class=\"muted\">84 · 13.3 · 1,350</td><td>5</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=10\" title=\"Pick level 10\"><td><b>10</b></td><td>31</td><td>10</td><td>500</td><td class=\"muted\">93 · 14 · 1,500</td><td>9</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Orc%20Camp\">Orc Camp</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>11</b></td><td>34</td><td>10.6</td><td>550</td><td class=\"muted\">102 · 14.8 · 1,650</td><td>10</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=12\" title=\"Pick level 12\"><td><b>12</b></td><td>37</td><td>11.1</td><td>600</td><td class=\"muted\">111 · 15.5 · 1,800</td><td>3</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=13\" title=\"Pick level 13\"><td><b>13</b></td><td>40</td><td>11.7</td><td>650</td><td class=\"muted\">120 · 16.4 · 1,950</td><td>21</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=15\" title=\"Pick level 15\"><td><b>15</b></td><td>46</td><td>12.8</td><td>750</td><td class=\"muted\">138 · 17.9 · 2,250</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=16\" title=\"Pick level 16\"><td><b>16</b></td><td>50</td><td>13.3</td><td>800</td><td class=\"muted\">150 · 18.6 · 2,400</td><td>9</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/orc?lv=17\" title=\"Pick level 17\"><td><b>17</b></td><td>54</td><td>13.9</td><td>850</td><td class=\"muted\">162 · 19.5 · 2,550</td><td>1</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/437e64fc8b90222ab1bd.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Plain</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/d4c4c3b2f7ca484e3cb0.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/d4c4c3b2f7ca484e3cb0.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Archer</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 1–14 · Deerhide armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/e6cc3f9e2ea9c5729d45.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Fire)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 1–14 · Imp armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/40ab31e96d5155127378.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Ice)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 1–14 · Imp armor</div></div></div><div class=\"look-card on\"><img src=\"data/img/e3ded7b2026d90b5a4d6.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Mage (Shock)</b><div class=\"g-note\">Level 1–14 · Imp armor</div></div></div></div>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 21 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 21 looted corpses, 92 recorded drops, 1,787 total, 6–99 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/21</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stolen-patrol-fitting\" title=\"Stolen Patrol Fitting - in 62% of 21 looted corpses, 13 recorded drops, 13 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b37ff097f17d2