"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">5% · 1/21</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Superior: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"snakeskin-head\" title=\"Snakeskin Head - in 5% of 21 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a3b5f57d33c5a9dcc2d2.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Snakeskin Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">5% · 1/21</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"imp-head\" title=\"Imp Head - in 5% of 21 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c8a4e1a95ebe7678a4ef.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Imp Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">5% · 1/21</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-legs\" title=\"Silver Legs - in 5% of 21 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/08ecaf2ee25350d177fd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">5% · 1/21</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"key_orc_champion\" title=\"Key_orc_champion - in 5% of 21 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c5432e0f347b2b46a59b.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Key_orc_champion</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">5% · 1/21</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"iron-legs\" title=\"Iron Legs - in 5% of 21 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a22f5bc4d5c388d24901.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Iron Legs</s